  "step_2": "The individual reports that the probability of winning was so low in both lotteries that they preferred trying to win a higher amount. The information considered by the individual includes the low probabilities of winning in both cases and the magnitude of the potential winnings. The justification for the choice centers on preferring a higher possible reward when the chances of winning are nearly negligible, implying a focus on the best possible outcome rather than probabilities or expected values.",
